      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PLAYBACK (2) box seated before sticking on well to finish 1.2 lengths away in second (24.29) at Traralgon in a Grade 5 over 425m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Good form should continue. DR. VIENNA (1) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a neck second (24.93) over 435m at this track. Expected to be in the finish again. DR. EXCLAIM (3) turned in an impressive display after leading around the bend to score nicely by 4 lengths at Traralgon over 425m (24.48) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. DR. ODIN (4) has strong claims after a top-three finish last time out.",
